    "path": "/about-us/",
    "slug": "about-us",
    "title": "Who Are We? - Jalpaji",
    "html": "\n\n\t\n\t<div class=\"page-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"48\" class=\"elementor elementor-48\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e70a825 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e70a825\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ee2d92 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0ee2d92\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41f8d43 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"41f8d43\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a948c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0a948c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Who We Are</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38b324b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"38b324b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Jalpaji is a diverse conglomerate with expertise in construction and global trading. We are driven by a vision to deliver quality, reliability, and innovation across industries. Whether it&#8217;s building world-class real estate projects or facilitating seamless trade in industrial and agricultural commodities, our commitment to excellence remains unwavering.</p><p>With a focus on sustainability, efficiency, and trust, we ensure that every project and partnership adds value and strengthens our reputation as a leader in the industry.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b9af6c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7b9af6c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Our Business Divisions</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f57c76 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8f57c76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Construction &amp; Real Estate </h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00e88c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"00e88c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At Jalpaji, we don’t just build structures—we create landmarks.</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-965a63c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"965a63c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our real estate and construction division specializes in:<br />✔ Residential &amp; Commercial Projects<br />✔ High-Quality Construction with Modern Designs<br />✔ Sustainable &amp; Long-Lasting Developments</p><p><strong>JALPAJI COMPLEX</strong> – Our flagship real estate project in Muzaffarpur, Bihar, offers premium residential and commercial spaces built with durability, aesthetics, and comfort in mind.</p><p>With cutting-edge technology and a commitment to architectural excellence, we are shaping the future of real estate.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6126ad0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6126ad0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Global Trading &amp; Commodities</h4>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74b9e5d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"74b9e5d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>With a strong global network, Jalpaji plays a key role in industrial and agro commodity trading, ensuring seamless supply chain management.</p><p><strong>Industrial Trading</strong></p><ul><li>Coal</li><li>Iron Ore &amp; Manganese Ore</li><li>Ferrous &amp; Non-Ferrous Scrap</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2bff9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c2bff9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Agro Commodity Trading</strong></p><ul><li>Raw Cashew Nuts (RCN)</li><li>Rice</li><li>Cocoa Beans &amp; Powder</li><li>Soybean</li><li>White Sesame (Til)</li><li>Gum Arabic</li><li>Shea Seeds &amp; Butter</li><li>Lentils &amp; Pulses</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-788ae1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"788ae1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Through strategic partnerships and efficient logistics, we ensure quality assurance, competitive pricing, and timely delivery for businesses worldwide.</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n"
